+    /**
+     * @brief 1905/EasyMesh-layer DPP credentials (netRole="mapAgent").
+     *
+     * Populated when the Agent receives the 1905-layer DPP Configuration
+     * Object — for wired DPP Extenders, via the GAS Config Response
